flowchart TD
    subgraph INGEST[Knowledge Base Ingestion - Manual]
        A[Manual Trigger] --> B[Find Knowledge Base Folder]
        B --> C[List Knowledge Base Documents]
        C --> D[Download Documents]
        D --> E[Document Loader + OpenAI Embeddings]
        E --> F[Insert into Pinecone]
    end
    subgraph EMAIL[Customer Email Handling]
        G[Gmail Trigger: every minute] --> H[Extract sender and email fields]
        H --> I[Prepare customer query from snippet]
        I --> J[Retrieve relevant knowledge from Pinecone]
        J --> K[Aggregate retrieved context]
        K --> L{Knowledge found?}
        L -- Yes --> M[GPT-4o-mini AI Agent]
        M --> N[Send HTML reply]
        L -- No --> O[Send fallback reply]
    end
